<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <!--
    CSP notes:
    - 'sha256-MdMapQxvxeL6vP8KdU8o5Ie9nNnnk3l94+maA3yW+k8=' is the SHA-256 hash of the
      MathJax configuration inline script block below. This replaces 'unsafe-inline'
      in script-src, allowing only this specific inline script to execute.
    - 'sha256-ieoeWczDHkReVBsRBqaal5AFMlBtNjMzgwKvLqi/tSU=' is the SHA-256 hash of
      Cloudflare Web Analytics' edge-injected inline beacon script. If Cloudflare
      updates their beacon, this hash will become stale and analytics will break again
      (you'll see a CSP error in DevTools with the new hash to use).
    - To recompute the MathJax hash after editing the config block, run from
      jpwolfson-site/:
        python3 -c "import hashlib,base64,sys; c=open('src/_includes/base.njk').read(); s=c.split(chr(60)+'script'+chr(62))[1].split(chr(60)+'/script'+chr(62))[0]; print('sha256-'+base64.b64encode(hashlib.sha256(s.encode()).digest()).decode())"
  -->
  <meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy"
        content="default-src 'self';
                 script-src 'self' 'sha256-MdMapQxvxeL6vP8KdU8o5Ie9nNnnk3l94+maA3yW+k8=' 'sha256-ieoeWczDHkReVBsRBqaal5AFMlBtNjMzgwKvLqi/tSU=' https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://static.cloudflareinsights.com;
                 style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline';
                 img-src 'self' data: https:;
                 font-src 'self' https://cdn.jsdelivr.net;
                 connect-src 'self' https://cloudflareinsights.com;
                 frame-src https://player.vimeo.com https://www.youtube.com;" />
  <title>{% if title %}{{ title }} – {% endif %}Jesse Wolfson</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
  <!-- CSP hash for this script: sha256-MdMapQxvxeL6vP8KdU8o5Ie9nNnnk3l94+maA3yW+k8= (referenced in script-src above) -->
  <script>
    MathJax = {
      tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$'], ['\\(', '\\)']] },
      options: { skipHtmlTags: ['script','noscript','style','textarea','pre'] }
    };
  </script>
  <!--
    MathJax – pinned to exact version for security.
    To update: change the version number and recompute the SRI hash:
      curl -sL https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3.2.2/es5/tex-chtml.js \
        | openssl dgst -sha384 -binary | openssl base64 -A | sed 's/^/sha384-/'
    Then update the integrity attribute below.
  -->
  <script async src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3.2.2/es5/tex-chtml.js"
          integrity="sha384-AHAnt9ZhGeHIrydA1Kp1L7FN+2UosbF7RQg6C+9Is/a7kDpQ1684C2iH2VWil6r4"
          crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="site-title"><a href="/">Jesse Wolfson</a></div>
    <nav>
      <a href="/working-group/">Working Group</a>
      <a href="/papers/">Papers</a>
      <a href="/talks/">Talks</a>
      <a href="/mathematics-and-dance/">Mathematics and Dance</a>
      <a href="/teaching/">Teaching</a>
      <a href="/workshops/">Workshops</a>
      <a href="/roosevelt-institute/">Roosevelt Institute</a>
      <a href="/cv/">CV</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
    {{ content | safe }}
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>Jesse Wolfson &middot; University of California, Irvine</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
